            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A roof window (1) comprising a frame (2), a sash (3), a pane (4), and a sealing system (5) is disclosed. The frame (2) comprises an adaptor member (24) attached at the inner side (211) of the at least one frame member, the adaptor member being used for fixation of a primary gasket (51) and/or for attachment of a secondary gasket (52). The adaptor member (24) may further be used for receiving a lining panel and/or may comprise a heat conductor component.</p>
            </abstract>
